---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Rachel Hveem Therapy | A space to feel more like yourself"
  description="Compassionate, collaborative therapy with Rachel Hveem. Schedule an appointment to begin."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Rachel Hveem Therapy home">Rachel Hveem <span>Therapy</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="header-cta" href="#contact">Schedule an Appointment</a>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Therapy for meaningful change</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">A space to feel more like yourself.</h1>
        <p class="intro">You don’t have to navigate life’s harder seasons alone. Together, we can make room for what you’re carrying and move toward what matters to you.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#contact">Schedule an Appointment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="sun"></div><div class="arch"></div><div class="stem stem-one"></div><div class="stem stem-two"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Welcome</p>
      <h2 id="welcome-title">You deserve a place to be heard.</h2>
      <p>Therapy can be a steady, caring space to pause, understand your experiences, and build a life that feels more aligned with who you are. My work is grounded in curiosity, respect, and the belief that you are the expert on your own life.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="approach" class="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">My approach</p>
        <h2 id="approach-title">Collaborative, compassionate, and centered on you.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-copy">
        <p>Our work will be shaped by your needs, your goals, and your pace. We’ll create a relationship where all parts of your story are welcome—without judgment or pressure to have it all figured out.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Learn how we can work together <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support for adults</p>
      <h2 id="services-title">A place to start, wherever you are.</h2>
      <ul class="service-list" role="list">
        <li><span>01</span><h3>Anxiety &amp; overwhelm</h3><p>Find steadier ground amid worry, stress, and the pressure of everyday life.</p></li>
        <li><span>02</span><h3>Life transitions</h3><p>Make sense of change, uncertainty, identity, and the next chapter ahead.</p></li>
        <li><span>03</span><h3>Relationships &amp; self-worth</h3><p>Explore the patterns that shape connection—with others and with yourself.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Take the first step</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Ready when you are.</h2>
        <p>Schedule a consultation to see whether working together feels like the right fit. Reaching out is a meaningful first step.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:hello@example.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <div><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
        <div><label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></div>
        <div><label for="message">What would you like support with? <span>(optional)</span></label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3"></textarea></div>
        <button class="button" type="submit">Request an Appointment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer><a class="brand" href="/">Rachel Hveem <span>Therapy</span></a><p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Rachel Hveem Therapy</p></footer>
  <a class="floating-cta" href="#contact">Schedule an Appointment</a>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .site-header, .hero, .welcome, .approach, .services, .contact, footer { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; }
  .site-header { min-height: 5.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
  .brand { text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.12rem; letter-spacing: .01em; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }.brand span { font-weight: 400; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 1.7rem; } nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: .88rem; } nav a:hover, .text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .header-cta, .button, .floating-cta { background: var(--terracotta); color: #fff; border: 2px solid var(--terracotta); text-decoration: none; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .7rem; min-height: 2.9rem; padding: .75rem 1.1rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .header-cta:hover, .button:hover, .floating-cta:hover { background: #823621; border-color: #823621; }
  .hero { min-height: 570px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; align-items: center; gap: 3rem; padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--sage-dark); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; } h1 { max-width: 680px; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6.4vw, 5.8rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1.7rem; } h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; } .intro, .welcome > p:last-child, .approach-copy p, .contact p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hero-art { position: relative; height: 410px; background: var(--sage); overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0 130px 0 0; }.sun { position: absolute; width: 190px; height: 190px; border-radius: 50%; top: 50px; right: 65px; background: #e6a96e; }.arch { position: absolute; background: var(--sage-dark); width: 260px; height: 340px; right: -45px; bottom: -145px; border-radius: 160px 160px 0 0; }.stem { position: absolute; width: 2px; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: bottom; bottom: 0; }.stem-one { height: 300px; left: 120px; transform: rotate(-20deg); }.stem-two { height: 250px; left: 175px; transform: rotate(28deg); }.stem::after { content: ''; width: 70px; height: 28px; display: block; position: absolute; top: 80px; border-radius: 100% 0; background: var(--ink); }.stem-two::after { top: 45px; transform: rotate(65deg); }
  .welcome { padding-top: 6rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; background: var(--surface); max-width: none; text-align: center; }.welcome > * { max-width: 710px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }.welcome > .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .approach { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; padding-top: 7rem; padding-bottom: 7rem; }.text-link { color: var(--sage-dark); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; }
  .services { padding-top: 5rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }.service-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; padding: 0; margin: 3rem 0 0; }.service-list li { list-style: none; padding: 1.5rem; min-height: 215px; background: var(--sage); }.service-list span { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--sage-dark); font-weight: 700; font-size: .8rem; }.service-list h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 2.5rem 0 .75rem; }.service-list p { color: #40514a; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; max-width: none; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding-top: 6rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; }.contact > * { max-width: 500px; }.contact .eyebrow { color: #b7d5bb; }.contact p { color: #d7e0da; }.contact-form { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }.contact-form div { display: grid; gap: .45rem; }.contact-form label { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; }.contact-form label span { font-weight: 400; }.contact-form input, .contact-form textarea { background: #fff; color: #17251f; border: 2px solid transparent; padding: .7rem; border-radius: 0; }.contact-form input:focus, .contact-form textarea:focus { border-color: #174f8b; outline: 3px solid #b8d9ff; }.contact-form .button { width: max-content; margin-top: .5rem; }
  footer { max-width: none; padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; } footer p { margin: 0; }.floating-cta { position: fixed; z-index: 10; right: 1.25rem; bottom: 1.25rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px #0004; }
  @media (max-width: 799px) { .site-header, .hero, .welcome, .approach, .services, .contact, footer { padding-left: 1.25rem; padding-right: 1.25rem; }.site-header { min-height: 4.75rem; }.site-header nav, .header-cta { display: none; }.hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 2.4rem; padding-bottom: 3.5rem; gap: 2.5rem; min-height: auto; }.hero-art { height: 270px; }.sun { width: 140px; height: 140px; right: 15%; }.arch { transform: scale(.75); transform-origin: bottom right; }.stem-one { left: 22%; }.stem-two { left: 40%; }.welcome, .approach, .services, .contact { padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }.approach, .contact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }.service-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 2rem; }.service-list li { min-height: auto; }.service-list h3 { margin-top: 1.4rem; } footer { padding-bottom: 6.3rem; flex-direction: column; }.floating-cta { left: 1rem; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; }.contact-form .button { width: 100%; } }
</style>
